    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d458">

                <pb facs="0762" n="666" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg666"/>

                <head>No. 459.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Brown to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1871-11-09"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 9, 1871</date>.
                        (Received December 11.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 31.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith copy
                    and translation of the note addressed to me by his excellency Server Pacha,
                    minister of foreign affairs, in answer to mine of the 20th ultimo, conveying to
                    the Ottoman government the regrets of the President on the occasion of the death
                    of His Highness Aali Pacha, the late Grand Vizier.</p>
                <p>I remain, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JOHN P. BROWN.</signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d458-a1.xml" xpointer="d458-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
